{#- Validated-confluence buy-GATE badge for the Standout grids (every country). Expects
    `sig` = the compact engine/signal_gate verdict attached to the card row (row['signal']).
    Renders the owner's WEIGHTED tier cascade (TIERED_CASCADE.md): T1 master (CONFIRMED or
    CONFIRMING) -> T2 PRIME -> T3 APPROACHING (2D cross projected ~1-2d) -> T4 FIRST SPARK.
    Stage names v2 per W8-R4 (china_alpha 2026-07-10); tier key + weight sub-chip unchanged.
    The tier·weight tag distinguishes them at a glance; the existing styles (take/pending/early)
    carry the colour so no new CSS is needed. A T3 additionally carries the PROVISIONAL
    "may repaint" flag (sig.provisional, W6 #22): it is projected off the incomplete 2D
    bucket and a measured 9.4% US / 0% CN of T3 fresh fires repaint when it completes
    (post-N=2 persistence hardening; calibration/provisional_replay.json). Bilingual; one
    source of truth so all grids render identically. Renders nothing when not eligible. -#}
{%- if sig -%}{%- if sig.htf_s1 %}<span class="sig-gate sig-htf-s1" data-tip-en="S1 · 2-week + 3-day confluence — higher-timeframe sponsorship (display-only)" data-tip-zh="S1 · 2周+3日共振 — 高周期确认（仅展示）"><span class="l-en">S1</span><span class="l-zh">S1</span></span>{% endif %}{%- endif -%}
{%- if sig and sig.eligible -%}
{%- set _tc = sig.tier_cascade -%}
{%- set _pending = (sig.sub == 'pending') -%}
{%- if _tc == 'T1' and not _pending -%}{%- set _k = 'take' -%}
{%- elif _tc == 'T1' and _pending -%}{%- set _k = 'pending' -%}
{%- elif _tc == 'T2' -%}{%- set _k = 't2' -%}
{%- elif _tc == 'T3' -%}{%- set _k = 't3' -%}
{%- elif _tc == 'T4' -%}{%- set _k = 't4' -%}
{%- else -%}{%- set _k = ('take' if sig.tier == 'take' else (sig.sub or 'early')) -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- set _style = {'take':'take','pending':'pending','t2':'t2','t3':'early','t4':'early','early':'early'}[_k] -%}
{%- set _glyph = {'take':'✓','pending':'◔','t2':'★','t3':'⋯','t4':'·','early':'⋯'}[_k] -%}
{%- set _en = {'take':'CONFIRMED','pending':'CONFIRMING','t2':'PRIME','t3':'APPROACHING','t4':'FIRST SPARK','early':'APPROACHING'}[_k] -%}
{%- set _zh = {'take':'确认','pending':'确认中','t2':'最佳入场','t3':'临近','t4':'初现','early':'临近'}[_k] -%}
{%- set _why = {'take':'CONFIRMED: master 3D confluence just confirmed — 3D MACD-RSI × 3D StochRSI cross, buy-filter endorsed.','pending':'CONFIRMING: master confluence signal forming, not yet confirmed — forward reclaim-and-hold confirmation pending.','t2':'PRIME: 2D cross with 3D support — historically filled at a lower median premium above the 20d trough than CONFIRMED (measured, not a forward promise).','t3':'APPROACHING: 3D StochRSI already crossed and the 2D MACD-RSI cross is PROJECTED within ~1–2 days — an early prediction, not yet confirmed. Provisional — may repaint: a measured 9.4% of US T3 fresh fires (post-N=2 hardening) un-cross within 4 sessions.','t4':'FIRST SPARK: earliest read — 2D stoch crossed + 2D MACD projected above 200-day MA. Lowest confidence.','early':'APPROACHING: 2D-MACD cross projected, 3D StochRSI already crossed.'}[_k] -%}
{%- set _why_zh = {'take':'CONFIRMED（确认）：主层3日共振已确认——3日MACD-RSI×3日StochRSI交叉，买入过滤器已背书。','pending':'CONFIRMING（确认中）：主层共振信号形成中，尚未确认——等待向前的收复确认。','t2':'PRIME（最佳入场）：2日交叉叠加3日支撑——历史上于20日低点以上中位溢价低于CONFIRMED成交（实测数据，非前瞻承诺）。','t3':'APPROACHING（临近）：3日StochRSI已上穿，2日MACD-RSI预计在约1–2日内交叉——提前预判，尚未确认。暂定——可能重绘：经N=2持久化修正后，实测美股9.4%的T3新信号会在4个交易日内取消交叉。','t4':'FIRST SPARK（初现）：最早读数——2日StochRSI已上穿、2日MACD预投影且在200日均线上方。置信度最低。','early':'APPROACHING（临近）：2日MACD交叉预测中，3日StochRSI已上穿。'}[_k] -%}
<span class="sig-gate sig-{{ _style }}" data-tip-en="{{ _why }}{% if sig.tier_cascade %} Tier {{ sig.tier_cascade }} · weight {{ sig.weight }}.{% endif %}{% if sig.tier_sub %} {{ 'deep-oversold' if sig.tier_sub == 'deep' else 'shallow pullback' }} cross.{% endif %}{% if sig.bars_to_cross is not none %} ~{{ sig.bars_to_cross }} 2D-bars to the cross.{% endif %}{% if sig.provisional %} PROVISIONAL — projected off the incomplete 2D bucket and may repaint when it completes: a measured 9.4% of US T3 fresh fires and 0% of CN vanish within 4 sessions (post-N=2 persistence hardening; calibration/provisional_replay.json, W6 #22).{% endif %} ONE door — confirm sector/leadership + your stop before acting.{% if sig.state %} · {{ sig.state|e }}{% endif %}{% if sig.asof %} · {{ sig.asof|e }}{% endif %}" data-tip-zh="{{ _why_zh }}{% if sig.tier_cascade %} 层级{{ sig.tier_cascade }}·权重{{ sig.weight }}。{% endif %}{% if sig.provisional %}T3为暂定评级：基于未完成的2日K线桶预测，桶完成后可能重绘（经N=2修正后实测美股9.4%、中国0%的T3新信号消失）。{% endif %} 一扇门——操作前请确认板块/龙头与止损。{% if sig.state %} · {{ sig.state|e }}{% endif %}{% if sig.asof %} · {{ sig.asof|e }}{% endif %}">{{ _glyph }} <span class="l-en">{{ _en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ _zh }}</span>{%- if sig.tier_cascade %} <span class="sig-w">{{ sig.tier_cascade }}·{{ '%.1f'|format(sig.weight) }}</span>{%- endif -%}{%- if sig.provisional %} <span class="prov-flag" data-tip-en="Provisional — may repaint. This T3 grade is projected off the INCOMPLETE 2-day bucket; when the bucket completes, a measured 9.4% of US T3 fresh fires and 0% of CN un-cross or veto-flicker within 4 sessions (post-N=2 persistence hardening; calibration/provisional_replay.json, W6 #22). T1/T2 measured 5.3%/8.8% — below the flip criterion, unflagged." data-tip-zh="暂定 — 可能重绘：该T3评级基于未完成的2日K线桶预测；桶完成后，经N=2修正后实测美股9.4%、中国0%的T3新信号在4个交易日内消失。"><span class="l-en">provisional</span><span class="l-zh">暂定</span></span>{%- endif -%}</span>
{%- endif -%}
